140
00:34:37,043 --> 00:34:38,323
QR vektörü ise,

141
00:34:41,663 --> 00:34:43,443
1-5,

142
00:34:44,344 --> 00:34:44,743
bakın,

143
00:34:45,983 --> 00:34:46,743
ara gelelim,

144
00:34:48,083 --> 00:34:49,143
R111,

